.TH "RAPTOR-VALIDATE" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-validate \- Check each MODEL the way a run would, without running; an .rbds file is also checked against the format's JSON Schema (see `raptor schema`). Exit 3 if any model has errors (or warnings, with \-\-strict).
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor validate\fR [\-h] [\-f {text,json}] [\-\-strict] MODEL [MODEL ...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check each MODEL the way a run would, without running; an .rbds file is also checked against the format's JSON Schema (see `raptor schema`). Exit 3 if any model has errors (or warnings, with \-\-strict).
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-f\fR, \fB\-\-format\fR \fI{text|json}\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
warnings are failures too
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Check several models.
.RS
.nf
\fBraptor validate *.rbd\fR
.fi
.RE
.PP
Fail (exit 3) on warnings too; machine\-readable.
.RS
.nf
\fBraptor validate pump.rbd \-\-strict \-f json\fR
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
\fB0\fR
success
.TP
\fB1\fR
runtime error
.TP
\fB2\fR
usage error
.TP
\fB3\fR
model invalid (validation errors)
.TP
\fB4\fR
model refused: a shape Raptor 7 cannot run
.TP
\fB5\fR
timed out or aborted; partial results written
.TP
\fB6\fR
output could not be written
.TP
\fB130\fR
interrupted (Ctrl\-C); partial results written
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_DEBUG\fR
same as \-\-debug
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_DEV_FEATURES\fR
same as \-\-dev\-features
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_CONFIG\fR
path of the settings file (same as \-\-config)
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_WORKSPACE\fR
default for \-\-workspace
.TP
\fBRAPTOR_SEED\fR
salt for every random stream (same as \-\-seed)
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fR
disable colour output
.TP
\fBXDG_CONFIG_HOME, XDG_DATA_HOME\fR
base directories
.SH FILES
.TP
\fB$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/raptor\-studio/config.toml\fR
settings file (see raptor\-config(5))
.TP
\fB$XDG_DATA_HOME/raptor\-studio/mcp\fR
default MCP server workspace
